Hammunition's infrastructure map style (src/hammunition/map_style/__init__.py)
takes Open Infrastructure Map's voltage colour ramp, `voltage_scale` in
web/src/style/style_oim_power.ts at commit 5f20a29a05946b5368598564615e92f6809ef5c4
(https://github.com/openinframap/openinframap), and the choice of which
infrastructure tags to draw. No other file of Open Infrastructure Map is
copied. Its licence, verbatim from the repository's LICENSE at that commit:

